<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#family-vodou-petwo> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Rhythms of the Petwo nation in Haitian Vodou, associated with fiercer and more demanding lwa (often Kongo-derived). Distinguished by faster tempos and specific drum preparation practices."@en .
