<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#inst-petwo-drum> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Drums used in Haitian Vodou Petwo nation ceremonies. Prepared differently from Rada drums; tighter skin tuning and faster tempo."@en .
