<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#setLineage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The musician lineage to which this drum set belongs. Particularly important for Añá bàtá: the Olubatá lineage determines performance rights and toque knowledge. Initiated-only."@en .
