<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#func-possession-induction> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The rhythm is specifically associated with inducing or deepening spirit possession in a prepared recipient. Initiated-only detail."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#func-farewell> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The rhythm signals or facilitates the departure of a spiritual entity from the ceremonial space."@en .
