<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#inst-atabaque> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Single-headed conical drum used in Candomblé in sets of three (rum/grande, rumpi/médio, lé/pequeno). May be consecrated; the rum (largest) typically leads."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#lineageHouse> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The religious house through which this musician lineage operates. Range: iroko:House."@en .
